This requirement applies to research papers, preprints, theses, technical reports, benchmark evaluations, conference presentations, and other publicly distributed scholarly or technical research outputs that materially rely on the Materials.

The required citations are:

**A. Original Research Paper**

Mei, Alex, Sharon Levy, and William Yang Wang. (2023). "ASSERT: Automated Safety Scenario Red Teaming for Evaluating the Robustness of Large Language Models." *Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP 2023*, pp. 5831–5847.

DOI: https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2023.findings-emnlp.388

**B. Software Repository**

ASSERT: Automated Safety Scenario Red Teaming — Official Research Implementation.

https://github.com/alexmeigz/ASSERT

